</math> yields&nbsp;<math alttext="negative 4 equals a"><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>. Substituting&nbsp;<math alttext="negative 4"><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> for <math alttext="a"><mi>a</mi>
</math>, <math alttext="23"><mn>23</mn>
