</math> to each side of this equation yields&nbsp;<math alttext="64 x squared plus 112 x plus 49 equals 576 plus 49"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>112</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>576</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext="left parenthesis 8 x plus 7 right parenthesis squared equals 625"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>625</mn></math>. Taking the square root of each side of this equation yields two equations: <math alttext="8 x plus 7 equals 25"><mrow>
