	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn>
</mrow>
</math>. Subtracting <math alttext="7"><mn>7</mn>
</math> from each side of the equation <math alttext="8 x plus 7 equals 25"><mrow>
