4c7/img_003_88e15967.png\" alt=\"open parenthesis, 2 x minus 3, close parenthesis, times, open parenthesis, x plus k, close parenthesis\"></span>; it follows that <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/16de54c7/img_004_0fb1c04e.png\" alt=\"open parenthesis, 2 x minus 3, close parenthesis, times, open parenthesis, x plus k, close parenthesis, equals, 2 x squared, plus 5 x, minus 12\"></span>. Expanding the left-hand side of this equation yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/16de54c7/img_005_d76453d9.png\" alt=\"2 x squared, plus 2 k x, minus 3 x, minus 3 k, equals, 2 x squared, plus 5 x, minus 12\"></span>. Subtracting <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/16de54c7/img_006_8a92b757.png\" alt=\"2 x squared \"></span> from both sides of this equation yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/16de54c7/img_007_e52b8c5f.png\" alt=\"2 k x minus 3 x, minus 3 k, equals, 5 x minus 12\"></span>. Using properties of equality, <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/16de54c7/img_008_4b610fcf.png\" alt=\"2 k x minus 3 x, equals 5 x\"></span> and <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/16de54c7/img_009_514d51be.png\" alt=\"negative 3 k, equals negative 12\"></span>. Either equation can be solved for <spa